    "status": "active",
    "map_url": "https://www.google.com/maps?q=-9.0,-157.8",
    "official_link": "https://www.google.com/maps?q=-9.0,-157.8",
    "country_code": null,
    "payload": {
      "item_type": "disturbance",
      "source": "jtwc_abpw",
      "source_key": "jtwc_abpw|south_pacific_area|invest_95p",
      "content_hash": "04d012336a0a8c52",
      "platform_summary": "9.0S 157.8W | winds 28-33 kt | 1005 mb | MEDIUM",
      "platform_location": "9.0S 157.8W",
      "wind": "28-33 kt",
      "risk_48h": null,
      "risk_7d": null,
      "next_update": null,
      "raw_text": "(1) THE AREA OF CONVECTION (INVEST 95P) PREVIOUSLY LOCATED NEAR \n9.3S 158.8W IS NOW LOCATED NEAR 9.0S 157.8W, APPROXIMATELY 823 NM EAST-\nNORTHEAST OF PAGO PAGO. ANIMATED ENHANCED INFRARED (EIR) SATELLITE \nIMAGERY AND A 140256Z SSMIS F18 91GHZ MICROWAVE IMAGE DEPICT A \nPARTIALLY-EXPOSED ELONGATED LOW LEVEL CIRCULATION CENTER (LLCC) WITH \nFLARING CONVECTION BUILDING ON THE EASTERN SEMICIRCLE. EIR AND THE \nMICROWAVE IMAGERY ALSO DEPICT SLOWLY CONSOLIDATING, FRAGMENTED, \nCONVECTIVE RAIN BANDS TO THE EAST OF THE LLCC. ENVIRONMENTAL ANALYSIS \nREVEALS A FAVORABLE ENVIRONMENT FOR DEVELOPMENT WITH LOW VERTICAL WIND \nSHEAR (VWS) OF 10-15 KNOTS, STRONG RADIAL OUTFLOW ALOFT DUE TO A POINT \nSOURCE DIRECTLY OVERHEAD, AND WARM SEA SURFACE TEMPERATURES (SST) OF \n29-30C. GLOBAL DETERMINISTIC AND ENSEMBLE MODELS ARE IN GOOD AGREEMENT \n95P WILL FURTHER CONSOLIDATE WITH MOST MEMBERS REACHING CRITERIA WITHIN \nTHE NEXT 24 HOURS AS IT TRACKS WESTWARD WITH GEFS BEING THE ONLY \nOUTLIER PREDICTING A NORTHWESTWARD TRACK OVER THE NEXT 48 HOURS. \nMAXIMUM SUSTAINED SURFACE WINDS ARE ESTIMATED AT 28 TO 33 KNOTS. \nMINIMUM SEA LEVEL PRESSURE IS ESTIMATED TO BE NEAR 1005 MB. THE \nPOTENTIAL FOR THE DEVELOPMENT OF A SIGNIFICANT TROPICAL CYCLONE WITHIN \nTHE NEXT 24 HOURS REMAINS MEDIUM.",
      "metadata": {
        "basin_section": "SOUTH PACIFIC AREA (WEST COAST OF SOUTH AMERICA TO 135 EAST)",
        "invest_id": "95P",
        "lat": -9.0,
        "lon": -157.8,
        "wind_kt_min": 28,
        "wind_kt_max": 33,
        "wind_kt": 33,
        "pressure_mb": 1005,
        "development_phrase": "REMAINS",
        "development_level": "MEDIUM",
        "bulletin_issue_at": "2026-11-14T06:00:00+00:00"
      }
    },
